      "settingGeometryVersion": "1.2.0",
      "description": "Transverse bars across a run, with the stones between adjacent bars. One component carrying every bar, each bar's own offset reported in its metadata. Bar spacing and length default to the stone's own measured extents, which places one bar on each side of a single stone. Retention only: the stones are the arrangement's, and no bar position is ever derived from a stone position or the reverse."
    },
