      "settingGeometryVersion": "1.2.0",
      "description": "Cylindrical reference prongs. RADIAL placement for round (byte-identical to pre-Sprint-19); OUTLINE_CARDINAL placement for every other outline, including custom ones. Placement is not tip-, corner- or anchor-aware. No seat, bearing, or cutter geometry exists. Sprint 23: opt-in REFERENCE_SEAT relief cuts the stone volume out of the metal; that is relief, not a cut seat with a bearing shoulder."
    },
